WEBVTT

00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:07.199
Happy New Year !

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:22.506
Oh, no ! We dropped it !

00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:25.926
We aren’t very good at this, are we… ?

00:00:44.486 --> 00:00:50.367
It’s punishment time !

00:01:49.051 --> 00:01:54.389
May this child be able to live
a happy life in Yatter Kingdom.

00:01:54.389 --> 00:01:59.561
Be happy, my angel, for your
daddy, who couldn’t live long.

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:04.107
Lady Dorothy…

00:02:04.107 --> 00:02:06.568
I knew you’d be here.

00:02:06.568 --> 00:02:11.281
You’re carrying a child.
Please don’t go out by yourself.

00:02:11.281 --> 00:02:13.450
W-We were worried.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.245
Now, let’s go home.

00:02:16.245 --> 00:02:18.205
Give me your hand.

00:02:20.457 --> 00:02:22.501
What’s the matter, Elephantus ?

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.253
Huh ?

00:02:24.253 --> 00:02:26.213
Nothing.

00:02:26.213 --> 00:02:29.132
Keep your body warm, Dorothy.

00:02:30.259 --> 00:02:31.677
Thank you.

00:02:32.761 --> 00:02:34.429
Lady Dorothy.

00:02:34.429 --> 00:02:37.391
Okay, Voltkatze.

00:02:40.769 --> 00:02:42.562
Honey…

00:02:43.814 --> 00:02:45.190
I’ll come again.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.739
That jerk !

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:58.537
What’d you do that for ? !

00:03:08.255 --> 00:03:10.924
It’s a lively girl.

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:14.011
Do you already have a name for her ?

00:03:18.307 --> 00:03:19.933
Leopard.

00:03:21.226 --> 00:03:23.979
My angel…

00:03:23.979 --> 00:03:27.316
Mommy loves your smile.

00:03:28.483 --> 00:03:31.111
Never stop smiling.

00:04:06.188 --> 00:04:11.526
Thus, Yatterman defeated the
v-villainous group Doronbow,

00:04:11.526 --> 00:04:21.536
with its members, Dokurobey,
Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra.

00:04:21.536 --> 00:04:26.541
The war ended and the world was saved !

00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:28.585
Everyone lived happily ever after.

00:04:28.585 --> 00:04:31.046
Yatterman is amazing !

00:04:31.046 --> 00:04:34.257
Yes, he’s a very admirable person.

00:04:34.257 --> 00:04:35.842
Admirable ?

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:41.306
He’s a hero. He punishes bad people.

00:04:41.306 --> 00:04:43.725
What does he do to punish them ?

00:04:43.725 --> 00:04:45.727
Let’s see…

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.022
Forehead flicking, maybe ?

00:04:50.982 --> 00:04:52.484
No…

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:59.574
This is "D," the one that comes
after "A," "B," and "C," right ?

00:04:59.574 --> 00:05:02.994
That’s right. I’m impressed
you were able to read it.

00:05:02.994 --> 00:05:06.581
"D"… "D"…

00:05:06.581 --> 00:05:09.543
This letter is in "forehead flicking," too !

00:05:09.543 --> 00:05:14.256
Be a good girl so that Lord Yatterman
won’t give you a forehead flicking.

00:05:14.256 --> 00:05:15.590
Yep !

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:18.718
Promise ?

00:05:19.761 --> 00:05:21.721
Promise !

00:05:27.686 --> 00:05:31.940
Lord Yatterman lives over there, right ?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:37.487
That’s right. It’s "Yatter Kingdom",
a land ruled by generations of Yatterman.

00:05:37.487 --> 00:05:40.907
I hear that it used to be called "Hulkkaido".

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.452
Hulkkaido !

00:05:43.452 --> 00:05:47.330
It’s a very beautiful kingdom
where there is a lot of food.

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.292
It’s a wonderful place.

00:05:50.292 --> 00:05:54.171
Wow, that’s amazing !
That sounds like Heaven !

00:05:54.171 --> 00:05:56.548
I wanna go there, too !

00:05:57.549 --> 00:05:59.718
Heaven…

00:05:59.718 --> 00:06:04.973
Yeah… I bet it’s a pretty place like heaven.

00:06:04.973 --> 00:06:06.391
If you are a good girl,

00:06:06.391 --> 00:06:11.480
you’ll be able to live a happy life in
Yatter Kingdom someday for sure.

00:06:12.481 --> 00:06:15.317
Yep ! I look forward to it !

00:06:25.619 --> 00:06:27.996
" High-school-girls"?

00:06:27.996 --> 00:06:30.123
What’s that ?

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:31.791
I don’t know.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.960
But this word "high-school-girls,"

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:39.799
which somehow sounds bittersweet,
suddenly crossed my mind.

00:06:41.051 --> 00:06:44.804
I hope you’ll figure out
what it’s about someday.

00:06:46.723 --> 00:06:52.020
Bubble… Bubble…

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.105
Ah !

00:06:54.105 --> 00:06:55.815
Honorable Oda ? !

00:07:14.876 --> 00:07:17.295
Honorable Oda !

00:07:18.547 --> 00:07:21.007
Where are you ? !

00:07:26.763 --> 00:07:28.723
Honorable Oda !

00:07:28.723 --> 00:07:31.309
I was told not to enter here !

00:07:38.108 --> 00:07:43.154
I feel like I’ve seen these people
in a picture book before…

00:07:53.331 --> 00:07:55.875
So you saw it.

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:59.462
Those people in the painting are our ancestors.

00:07:59.462 --> 00:08:01.298
Our ancestors ? !

00:08:01.298 --> 00:08:08.096
That’s right. The woman is our ancestor.
Her name is Doronjo.

00:08:08.096 --> 00:08:14.269
The man with a big nose is Boyacky.
He’s Voltkatze’s ancestor.

00:08:14.269 --> 00:08:16.730
And the other man is Tonzra.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.358
He’s Elephantus’s ancestor.

00:08:20.358 --> 00:08:23.320
Voltkatze and Elephantus’s families...

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.324
...have been serving our family for a long time.

00:08:27.324 --> 00:08:33.830
B-But weren’t Doronjo
and the others thieves ? !

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.206
That’s right.

00:08:36.708 --> 00:08:40.754
Stealing is bad.

00:08:40.754 --> 00:08:45.508
You know there was a big war
a long time ago, don’t you ?

00:08:45.508 --> 00:08:48.887
Yeah… I read it in a picture book.

00:08:48.887 --> 00:08:54.517
After the war ended, Lord Yatterman
built Yatter Kingdom in Hulkkaido

00:08:54.517 --> 00:08:57.604
so that people could live in peace,

00:08:57.604 --> 00:09:01.149
and Doronjo and the others
were exiled to a remote region.

00:09:01.149 --> 00:09:05.236
Time passed, and new generations
replaced older generations.

00:09:05.236 --> 00:09:08.615
And yet, we are still
being punished even now.

00:09:10.825 --> 00:09:16.498
We live this way because of our ancestors.

00:09:16.498 --> 00:09:20.001
They really caused us big trouble.

00:09:20.001 --> 00:09:24.673
So, be a good girl, Leopard…

00:09:24.673 --> 00:09:28.093
…until the day our ancestors’
wrongdoings are forgiven

00:09:28.093 --> 00:09:33.014
and you can live in the
heavenly Yatter Kingdom.

00:09:37.352 --> 00:09:39.020
Okay !

00:09:42.399 --> 00:09:46.611
Honorable Oda, let’s be good !

00:09:46.611 --> 00:09:49.906
We can’t become like our ancestors, okay ? !

00:09:51.032 --> 00:09:52.450
I don’t want this !

00:09:53.952 --> 00:09:55.870
Let’s go, Honorable Oda !

00:10:20.629 --> 00:10:25.384
Happy ninth birthday, Leopard !

00:10:25.384 --> 00:10:29.554
Happy birthday !

00:10:30.889 --> 00:10:32.724
Thank you !

00:10:32.724 --> 00:10:34.351
Here.

00:10:34.351 --> 00:10:38.230
This is for you, my dear angel.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:41.650
Whoa ! It’s new book !

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:47.114
Voltkatze and Elephantus
looked very hard for it.

00:10:47.114 --> 00:10:51.076
You love books, Miss Leopard, so…

00:10:51.076 --> 00:10:53.787
Study hard, okay ?

00:10:53.787 --> 00:10:56.498
Yep ! Thank you !

00:10:56.498 --> 00:10:59.960
Now… let’s ea…

00:11:02.421 --> 00:11:05.090
Are you okay, Mom ?

00:11:06.091 --> 00:11:09.052
Yes, I’m okay.

00:11:09.052 --> 00:11:11.346
I’m okay.

00:11:12.472 --> 00:11:17.894
More importantly, I'm sorry
that I couldn’t prepare much.

00:11:17.894 --> 00:11:19.938
Not a problem !

00:11:19.938 --> 00:11:25.068
Everything you make testes delicious !

00:11:25.068 --> 00:11:27.112
I love it all !

00:11:28.947 --> 00:11:32.701
Eat mine, too, Leopard.

00:11:32.701 --> 00:11:34.286
You, too, Honorable Oda.

00:11:34.286 --> 00:11:35.954
Are you sure ?

00:11:35.954 --> 00:11:42.461
Yeah. The longer I wait, the more
I’ll appreciate it later, so…

00:11:42.461 --> 00:11:43.670
What do you mean by that ? !

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.382
Ah ! You’re eating too much, Honorable Oda !

00:11:47.382 --> 00:11:48.592
There are no forks.

00:11:48.592 --> 00:11:51.720
You’re sitting the closest
to them. You go get them.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:53.930
I'm not gonna get one for you.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.974
That sounds like heaven !

00:11:55.974 --> 00:11:58.226
I wanna go there, too !

00:11:58.226 --> 00:11:59.853
Heaven…

00:11:59.853 --> 00:12:04.316
Yeah… I bet it’s a pretty place like heaven.

00:12:04.316 --> 00:12:06.651
Honey…

00:12:06.651 --> 00:12:08.195
This place is…

00:12:09.488 --> 00:12:11.114
This place is…

00:12:13.116 --> 00:12:14.993
…my…

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:25.587
I was somehow able to save her life.

00:12:25.587 --> 00:12:30.842
But with my techniques and the
equipment that’s available in this area,

00:12:30.842 --> 00:12:33.553
this is the best I can do.

00:12:33.553 --> 00:12:37.015
If we at least had medicine…

00:12:55.575 --> 00:12:58.036
Oh, sorry !

00:12:58.036 --> 00:12:59.704
A-Are you okay ? !

00:12:59.704 --> 00:13:03.708
L-Leopard… By herself…

00:13:15.053 --> 00:13:17.514
Miss Leopard !

00:13:17.514 --> 00:13:19.432
Don’t stop me !

00:13:21.518 --> 00:13:24.729
I'm gonna go to Yatter Kingdom !

00:13:24.729 --> 00:13:28.733
I'm sure Lord Yatterman will help us !

00:13:30.402 --> 00:13:31.987
Miss !

00:13:31.987 --> 00:13:33.947
Leopard !

00:13:33.947 --> 00:13:38.493
There’s no other way to save Mom !

00:13:38.493 --> 00:13:39.286
Let go of me !

00:13:39.286 --> 00:13:42.080
I won’t let go of you no matter what !

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:54.759
We want to save Lady Dorothy at any cost.

00:13:56.261 --> 00:14:00.890
Elephantus and I both
feel the same way you do.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.101
There’s a ship over there.

00:14:04.311 --> 00:14:07.981
I thought something like this might happen,
so I went ahead and made an engine.

00:14:07.981 --> 00:14:09.941
Amazing !

00:14:09.941 --> 00:14:13.278
I asked Elephantus to install it.

00:14:13.278 --> 00:14:14.779
Leopard !

00:14:14.779 --> 00:14:16.072
Yep !

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:24.539
If we go to Yatter Kingdom, we can save Mom !

00:14:24.539 --> 00:14:27.375
Lord Yatterman will help us !

00:14:27.375 --> 00:14:29.669
Hey !

00:14:29.669 --> 00:14:33.882
Th-This is too fast !

00:14:37.302 --> 00:14:40.472
I'm being blown away--

00:14:40.472 --> 00:14:42.849
Are you okay, Honorable Oda ? !

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:56.529
L-Look !

00:14:56.529 --> 00:14:59.991
Let’s head for that lighthouse for now.

00:14:59.991 --> 00:15:04.245
Wait just… a little bit longer, Mom.

00:15:06.706 --> 00:15:09.000
Hey ! Just how long are you gonna sleep ? !

00:15:11.002 --> 00:15:13.004
We’re already there ?

00:15:38.154 --> 00:15:43.993
lt looks the same as…
the wall deep in the mountains ?

00:15:53.753 --> 00:15:56.047
There’s nothing to worry about.

00:15:56.047 --> 00:16:00.719
We’ve got our hero, Yatterman.

00:16:00.719 --> 00:16:05.890
As long as Yatterman exists,
evil will have ne place in this world.

00:16:06.891 --> 00:16:10.520
That’s Lord and Lady Yatterman !

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:13.148
--Hello !
--They’re the legendary…

00:16:13.148 --> 00:16:16.401
Lord and Lady Yatterman !

00:16:16.401 --> 00:16:20.363
Hello ! Lord and Lady Yatter…

00:16:22.073 --> 00:16:23.658
…man…

00:16:23.658 --> 00:16:25.535
Leopard !

00:16:25.535 --> 00:16:27.746
Leave !

00:16:27.746 --> 00:16:31.916
Those without permission cannot
come close to Yatter Kingdom !

00:16:31.916 --> 00:16:36.463
If you come any closer,
you will receive punishment !

00:16:36.463 --> 00:16:39.424
By  "punishment," does he
mean forehead flicking ? !

00:16:39.424 --> 00:16:42.093
I don’t think so.

00:16:42.093 --> 00:16:45.722
Listen ! My mom is sick, so…

00:16:45.722 --> 00:16:48.224
Voltkatze !

00:16:48.224 --> 00:16:49.934
Okay !

00:16:56.483 --> 00:16:59.986
This is… nothing !

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.297
Lord Yatterman…

00:17:24.385 --> 00:17:26.012
Why… ?

00:17:31.184 --> 00:17:32.852
Mom…

00:17:34.187 --> 00:17:35.980
Mom…

00:17:38.233 --> 00:17:40.652
Don’t cry.

00:17:40.652 --> 00:17:44.155
I'm going to heaven now, that’s all.

00:17:47.784 --> 00:17:50.453
Don’t cry…

00:17:50.453 --> 00:17:55.500
…because I love your smile.

00:17:56.709 --> 00:17:59.170
Mom…

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:02.131
Never stop smiling, okay ?

00:18:02.131 --> 00:18:04.551
Promise me that.

00:18:04.551 --> 00:18:06.970
I promise.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.028
Leopard…

00:18:24.028 --> 00:18:27.866
My… angel

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.379
Mom…

00:18:51.055 --> 00:18:53.057
I'm sorry.

00:18:54.058 --> 00:18:58.771
I want to smile, but I can’t.

00:18:59.898 --> 00:19:04.235
It’s okay to cry just for now, right ?

00:19:10.742 --> 00:19:15.622
So Lord Yatterman wasn’t a hero ?

00:19:15.622 --> 00:19:22.086
A hero wouldn’t ignore
people in trouble, right ?

00:19:22.086 --> 00:19:27.091
They live happin in the
heavenly Yatter Kingdom…

00:19:27.091 --> 00:19:30.303
We didn’t do anything wrong.

00:19:34.515 --> 00:19:40.146
I wonder if my ancestor
was really a bad person…

00:19:41.481 --> 00:19:44.859
Could it be that Yatterman
was the one who was bad ?

00:19:44.859 --> 00:19:49.989
Maybe she was fighting to defeat them ?

00:19:49.989 --> 00:19:56.996
’Cause I can’t believe
that Yatterman is a hero.

00:19:56.996 --> 00:20:01.709
If he were really a hero,
he would’ve saved mom.

00:20:01.709 --> 00:20:05.964
Yeah… ! I'm sure that must be it !

00:20:05.964 --> 00:20:10.468
This world is pitch-black because
of Lord and Lady Yatterman.

00:20:10.468 --> 00:20:13.763
I won’t be satisfied until I punish them.

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:18.142
For our ancestors…

00:20:18.142 --> 00:20:21.688
…for my mom…

00:20:21.688 --> 00:20:27.026
…and for us as well…
let’s go to Yatter Kingdom !

00:20:27.026 --> 00:20:29.529
My mom is waiting !

00:20:29.529 --> 00:20:32.156
We all feel the same.

00:20:32.156 --> 00:20:33.616
Let’s go !

00:20:39.831 --> 00:20:41.332
Yep…

00:20:41.332 --> 00:20:44.836
Let’s go… together !

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.182
I tried to base these
clothes off of the originals,

00:20:58.182 --> 00:21:01.853
but I really am not good at sewing.

00:21:01.853 --> 00:21:06.441
Yeah, I'm only good at
doing heavy lifting, so…

00:21:06.441 --> 00:21:09.610
Just wait, Mom !

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.696
Great Dokurobey…

00:21:11.696 --> 00:21:13.698
…please watch over us !

00:21:13.698 --> 00:21:17.952
We will inherit the souls of our ancestors !

00:21:24.709 --> 00:21:26.753
I'm Doronjo !

00:21:26.753 --> 00:21:28.880
I'm Boyacky !

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:31.049
I'm Tonzra !

00:21:33.634 --> 00:21:36.554
We are…

00:21:36.554 --> 00:21:39.307
…Doronbow !

00:21:39.307 --> 00:21:41.809
Let’s go, guys !

00:21:41.809 --> 00:21:44.854
We’re gonna punish Yatterman !

00:21:44.854 --> 00:21:48.149
We’ll give them a forehead
flicking with all our might !

00:21:48.149 --> 00:21:51.569
Yes, ma’am !

00:21:51.611 --> 00:21:55.073
Be pure ! Be right ! Be beautiful !

00:21:55.073 --> 00:21:57.408
As long as Doronbow exists,

00:21:57.408 --> 00:22:00.912
Yatterman will have no place in this world !

00:22:00.912 --> 00:22:06.751
We’ll drive the darkness away and
bring a new dawn to this world !

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:31.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:37.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:42.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:48.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:22:50.230 --> 00:22:53.480
We don't need no reasons

00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:58.570
To change for the better

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:05.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:23:05.870 --> 00:23:07.960
You're a shooting star

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:11.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:16.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:18.550
Light on the shooting star

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:24.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:27.680
Let's go in search of it

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:32.440
Fly away
